{"at":1795723245137,"value":{"symbol":"DEEPAKNTR","name":"Deepak Nitrite Ltd","screenerId":"786","fetchedAt":"2026-11-26T20:00:45.121Z","about":"Incorporated in 1970, Deepak Nitrite Ltd manufactures Basic Intermediates, Fine & Speciality Chemicals, Performance Products, and Phenolics","keyPoints":"Business Segments: \nThe company is one of the fastest growing chemical intermediates companies in India with a portfolio of 36+ products and 56+ applications, divided into 2 segments:\na) Phenolics (68% in FY26 vs 70% in FY25):  \nThe company produces Cumene, Phenol, Acetone, Isopropyl Alcohol, Alpha Methyl Styrene (AMS), etc., catering to industries like laminates & plywood, automotive, construction, pharmaceuticals, and adhesives. It is the largest producer of Phenol and Acetone in India with a 50% market share. \nb) Advanced Intermediates (32% in FY26 vs 30% in FY25):  \nThe company manufactures Nitrites, Nitro Toluidines, Xylidines, Oxyimes, Cumidines, Optical Brightening Agents (OBA), DASDA, etc., serving industries like colorants, dyes, rubber, paper, agrochemicals, pharmaceuticals, water treatment, etc. It is India's largest producer of Sodium Nitrite and ranks among the top 3 global manufacturers of Xylidines and Oximes.","sector":null,"industry":"Specialty Chemicals","peers":[],"ratios":{"Market Cap":"₹ 20,763 Cr.","Current Price":"₹ 1,522","High / Low":"₹ 1,898 / 1,280","Stock P/E":"19.4","Book Value":"₹ 475","Dividend Yield":"0.49 %","ROCE":"11.4 %","ROE":"9.82 %","Face Value":"₹ 2.00"},"quarters":{"periods":["Sep 2023","Dec 2023","Mar 2024","Jun 2024","Sep 2024","Dec 2024","Mar 2025","Jun 2025","Sep 2025","Dec 2025","Mar 2026","Jun 2026","Sep 2026"],"rows":{"Sales":[1778,2009,2126,2167,2032,1903,2180,1890,1902,1975,2120,2578,3076],"YoY Sales growth":[-9,1,8,23,14,-5,3,-13,-6,4,-3,36,62],"Expenses":[1476,1705,1825,1858,1734,1735,1863,1700,1698,1764,1744,2037,2450],"Operating Profit":[302,305,301,309,298,169,317,190,204,211,376,540,627],"OPM %":[17,15,14,14,15,9